==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Pterowl Hazuku]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*4 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to rush the stage with fast, short-ranged units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] and even [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]], even with the other enemies in the way, then take out H. Nah later on.

[[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]], if you have it, can help cheese the stage if sent whenever you can at the start before Pterowl Hazuku spawns and if it kills the Trolly Blogger.

Using this strategy, you can send [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot Cat/Green Shell Cat]] when you have money, then send [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], continue sending Cleanerbots/Green Shells until the base is destroyed or Hazuku dies.

